      "id": "LI00234",
      "sourceId": "LI00234",
      "url": null,
      "text": "The hardest part of hiring isn't finding candidates. It's everything in between. The scheduling. The reschedules. The \"can we move this to Thursday?\" The chasing feedback. None of it is hard. But it all gets in the way. It eats time, and done wrong, it quietly wrecks the candidate experience. And when tactics pile up, the real work is the first thing to go. Sourcing slips, and recruiters drift into post-and-pray mode. Gross. Nobody wants tactics running their team. And nobody puts Baby in the corner. I've been using candidate.fyi for a while, and it’s legit. Coordination? Handled. Candidate experience? Awesome. This week, they launched the next version: agents that handle logistics end-to-end, so TA teams can stay focused on the right work. Pretty cool! 👇 Let's go! #recruiting #hiring #coordinating #talentacquisition … more",
