      "id": "LI00235",
      "sourceId": "LI00235",
      "url": null,
      "text": "Recruitment isn't just about finding people... It's about getting the whole process right 👀 We see hundreds of recruitment processes, and one thing is clear... The little things make a huge difference 🙌 And we’ve found a few ways to make hiring that little bit smoother 👇 🍏Write a job advert that actually sounds like you - Skip the generic, AI-generated copy, candidates want to know what the role, team and company are really like 🍏Don't hang around - The strongest candidates get snapped up quickly, so keeping momentum can be the difference between making a hire and missing out 🍏Stay in touch after they've accepted - A quick call or message during their notice period goes a long way in keeping excitement high before day one 🍏Keep communication clear from start to finish - honest updates and timely feedback create a much better candidate experience, even if the answer isn't always a yes Recruitment isn't always about making big changes... Sometimes it's the small habits that have the biggest impact 🙌 What mistakes have you found in your hiring process? … more",
