      "id": "LI00239",
      "sourceId": "LI00239",
      "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7522264393527545857/",
      "text": "Looking for a real career horror story? 👻 It isn’t a server crash on a Friday afternoon or a typo sent to 10,000 subscribers. It’s \"Ghosting\"—and it's haunting today's job market. Whether it’s a candidate disappearing before a final interview or an employer leaving a professional in limbo after three rounds, ghosting hurts everyone. It burns bridges, damages employer brands, and wastes valuable time. This Halloween, let’s make a commitment to bring transparency back to business communication: • Send the update. Even if the timeline is delayed, a quick note goes a long way. • Deliver the constructive feedback. Candidates appreciate clarity over radio silence. • Keep your commitments. If you need to reschedule, communicate early. The best professional relationships are built on respect, not disappearing acts. Let's leave the ghosting to the haunted houses this year! 🎃 #Professionalism #Recruiting #HR #CompanyCulture #Halloween2026 … more",
