      "text": "🚀 We're Hiring at Arm | Senior System QA Engineer | Bengaluru Passionate about Linux, System Validation, and solving complex hardware-software challenges? This opportunity could be for you! At Arm, we're shaping the future of computing, and we're looking for a talented Senior System QA Engineer to join our Central Engineering – Software (CE-SW) team in Bengaluru. 💡 What makes this opportunity exciting? You'll work at the intersection of Hardware, Firmware, and Software, helping ensure the reliability, performance, and stability of next-generation server and SoC platforms. 🔍 We're looking for engineers with experience in: ✅ Linux System Validation, Debugging & Root Cause Analysis ✅ Python, C/C++ & Shell Scripting for Test Automation ✅ System-Level Testing – Functional, Performance, Stress & Stability ✅ Linux Kernel, Device Drivers, Firmware & Platform Bring-up ✅ Server/SoC Architecture, PCIe, Networking & Storage Validation Jay Jayatheerthan Bipin Ravi Ashwanth Chandrasekar Chirag Bhayani Sophia A Aishwarya KP 📢 Know someone who would be a great fit? Tag them in the comments or share this opportunity with your network! Come build what's next with Arm! 🚀 #Arm #WereHiring #SeniorSystemQAEngineer #Linux #SystemValidation #TestAutomation #Python #EmbeddedSystems #SoC #SoftwareEngineering #BangaloreJobs #TechCareers #SolveWhatsNext … more",
