      "text": "Happy Halloween. Four costumes we have all worn this year. \"Entry level job ad.\" 3 years of experience not included. \"New grad.\" Experience sold separately. \"The ATS.\" Has never met a human. The scariest part of hiring is not any of those. It is that nobody looks at the actual work. On TalentInn a named mentor checks your work and signs it. Companies see the work and who checked it, not keywords. No costume needed. Proof over promises. talentinn[dot]com Which one have you worn this year? New grads, tell us what you built. #Halloween #NewGrads #JobSearch #EarlyCareer #Hiring … more",
