      "text": "I’m hiring across Data & AI for opportunities in the UAE 🇦🇪 🔹 Data Scientist | Remote option Strong Python and ML experience, covering data preparation, model development, validation and production delivery. Experience with GenAI, RAG, agentic workflows and MLOps would be a plus. 🔹 Backend Engineer – Python | Remote option Experience building production-ready Python APIs, services and data integrations. You’ll develop agentic workflows alongside Data Scientists and domain specialists. Exposure to LLMs, RAG and orchestration frameworks such as LangGraph or Semantic Kernel would be beneficial. 🔹 Lead AI Engineer | UAE A hands-on lead opportunity for someone looking to grow into management. You’ll initially focus on technical leadership and AI delivery, with the goal of moving into a management role over the coming year as the team develops. If you’re interested, please send me your CV and let me know which role you’d like to discuss. Recommendations are always welcome! #Hiring #DataScience #Python #AIEngineering #UAEJobs … more",
