      "id": "LI00249",
      "sourceId": "LI00249",
      "url": null,
      "text": "Be a firework this Bonfire Night and give top candidates a reason to look up. 🎇 The best candidates are usually watching more than one display. If your hiring process fizzles out, they’ll find a brighter one. Here’s how to make your process stand out: → Light the fuse quickly. Long gaps between interview stages are where good candidates drop out. → Show what’s on offer. Put salary and benefits in the job ad and the first conversation. Don’t save them for the offer stage. → Sell the role, not just the requirements. Tell people why they’d want the job, as well as what you need from them. → Finish with a bang. Make clear offers quickly and give feedback quickly, even when it’s a no. Hiring in sales, marketing, or engineering? Talk to our team about getting the right people in for the new year: [link hidden] ?utm_source=LinkedIn&utm_medium=Hiring-post&utm_campaign=LinkedIn-Bonfire-night&utm_id=Bonfire-night #bonfirenight #hiring #talentacquisition #recruitment … more",
