      "text": "Most hiring pipelines are not actually pipelines. They are a fragile chain of manual tasks: downloading PDFs, copying data, and sending repetitive emails. When you spend your day acting as human middleware, you have less time to actually evaluate talent. We built HireSquire to fix this system design flaw. By automating the administrative heavy lifting, you can transition from application receipt to interview scheduling without the manual friction. Our tool handles the parsing, multi-stage screening, and candidate matching in the background. You get to focus on the human decisions that actually matter. We wrote a practical guide on how to design an end-to-end automated hiring workflow that keeps your pipeline moving without losing your sanity. Read the full guide: [link hidden] #Hiring #Recruitment #HRTech #HireSquire … more",
