      "id": "LI00268",
      "sourceId": "LI00268",
      "url": null,
      "text": "🚨 RECRUITERS & EMPLOYERS — I WANT TO HEAR FROM YOU! Let's face it. The hiring process is broken, and AI is making some of its biggest problems even worse. ❌ Fake and inflated résumés ❌ Candidates who aren't who they claim to be ❌ Endless screening and wasted interviews ❌ Automated filters overlooking qualified talent ❌ Recruiting costs that keep climbing ❌ Valuable time and money wasted on both sides What if we could change the entire process? 🚀 I'm building HireOnce. Hiring Reversed. Everyone Verified. Instead of candidates applying to hundreds of jobs, HireOnce is designed so verified recruiters and employers apply directly to verified candidates. Imagine a platform where you can: ✅ Search candidates using standardized profiles, making qualifications easier to compare. ✅ Review verified identities and supporting skills evidence. ✅ See candidates' salary expectations, experience, availability, and work preferences. ✅ Present your opportunity directly to the candidates you actually want to hire. ✅ Spend less time filtering through questionable applications and more time connecting with real talent. 💡 BUT HERE'S WHERE I NEED YOUR HELP. I don't want to build another hiring platform based solely on what I *think* recruiters and employers need. I want the recruiting and hiring community to help shape HireOnce. What features would make your job easier? What frustrates you most about today's recruiting platforms? What would save your company time and money? What would make you trust a candidate's profile? 🌐 Visit [link hidden] 👉 Check out the vision and proposed features. 👉 Join the FREE early-access waitlist. 👉 Use the Suggestions & Feedback field to tell me what you'd like to see. HireOnce is still in development, and features may change before launch. That's exactly why your input matters now. Your feedback won't just be another comment lost in a discussion. It can help influence what we build. I'm inviting recruiters, hiring managers, HR professionals, staffing agencies, and business owners to be part of this from the beginning. 🔁 Repost this to help get more voices involved. Let's stop accepting a broken hiring process and start building something better together. HireOnce — Hiring Reversed. Everyone Verified. #HireOnce #Recruitment #TalentAcquisition #HiringManagers #Recruiters #HRTech #Staffing #FutureOfHiring #HiringInnovation #Startup … more",
