      "url": null,
      "text": "\"The Strategic Shift in Mid-to-Senior Service & Operations Sourcing\" Having steered corporate Talent Acquisition and complex operational matrices from the inside for nearly two decades, I’ve observed a persistent market reality: high-volume recruitment platforms frequently fail to filter for the execution grit, soft skills, and localized retention markers required for mission-critical leadership roles. My journey across India’s corporate services, logistics, and infrastructure ecosystems has given me an institutional view of these exact hiring bottlenecks: 🔹 The Foundations: Managing end-to-end recruitment operations early on with firms like Sunabh HR x Blue Apple Corp, executing precise mid-to-senior level talent mandates for market titans including JLL, Godrej Properties, and Travel Food Services (TFS). 🔹 The Enterprise Scale: Head of workspace grids, corporate services, and complex workforce grids from the inside with institutional giants like Sodexo and Knight Frank. 🔹 The Media & Infrastructure Era: Navigating massive operational infrastructure, facility setups, and specialized delivery footprints with powerhouse brands like Adlabs Imagica and Allcargo Logistics [INDEX]. When internal TA teams are stretched thin, adding volume to your inbox isn't the solution. Precision mapping is. We founded Connexis Talent Advisory to bridge this exact gap. We operate as a boutique search extension focused entirely on mid-to-senior management talent within the service, logistics, and corporate operations sectors. We operate on a strict contingency basis (no-cure, no-pay)—delivering a highly vetted, accurate shortlist only when you face critical hiring bottlenecks. To the business heads, operations leaders, and TA directors across my expanding network: What is the single biggest talent bottleneck your teams are navigating as we approach the final stretch of the year? Let’s connect. #ExecutiveSearch #CorporateServices #Logistics #OperationsLeadership #TalentAcquisition #ConnexisTalent #MumbaiBusiness … more",
