      "id": "LI00478",
      "sourceId": "LI00478",
      "url": null,
      "text": "🚇 Build the Infrastructure That Moves Millions We're Hiring | Amberg Engineering India, Gurugram For over five decades, the Amberg Group has been a trusted name in underground and infrastructure engineering. Headquartered in Switzerland, the Group brings together specialists in engineering, tunnelling technology, digital infrastructure, and testing, contributing to some of the world's most demanding tunnel, rail, metro, and hydropower projects. Driven by Swiss engineering precision, technical excellence, and innovation, the Amberg Group has built an international presence across the world including Europe, Asia, the United Kingdom etc. Amberg Engineering India, a wholly owned subsidiary of the Amberg Group has been delivering world-class engineering solutions since establishing its presence in India in 2011. Over the years, we have played a key role in some of the country's most complex and iconic infrastructure projects. As we continue to expand our footprint across India and international markets, we are looking for talented and ambitious professionals to join our multidisciplinary design teams and contribute. 📢 We're Hiring Across the Following Disciplines ✅ Structural Design ✅ Geotechnical Design ✅ Metro, Underground Infrastructure & E&M Design ✅ Digital Engineering & BIM (Architecture, Civil, Structural & MEP) 🎯 Open Roles - Trainee | Design Engineer | Senior Engineer | Manager | General Manager 📌 Experience: 2-20+ Years 📍 Location: India 🌟 Why Build Your Career with Amberg? 🌍 Shape the future of mobility by delivering landmark metro, rail, tunnel, and infrastructure projects in India and across the globe. 🇨🇭 Collaboration with Swiss and international engineering teams. 📈 Strong focus on technical excellence, continuous learning, and career growth. If you're passionate about engineering and excited by challenging infrastructure projects that shape the future of mobility, we'd love to hear from you. 📩 For more details regarding the role, Job Description (JD), Key Result Areas (KRA), and career opportunities, please contact us or share your profile at: [email hidden] 📌 Subject Line: Resume | Position Applied For Know someone who would be a great fit? Tag them in the comments or share this opportunity with your network. #Hiring #AmbergEngineering #Infrastructure #MetroRail #StructuralEngineering #GeotechnicalEngineering #BIM #TunnelEngineering #DigitalEngineering #UrbanInfrastructure #EngineeringExcellence #CareerGrowth #NowHiring Amberg Group Amberg Engineering Amberg Engineering, India Amberg Infocon (AGI) Sri Prakash Barad Kumar Sharma Gagandeep Kansal Vivek Dubey Dr. Jai Ballabh Ghildiyal Mayank Sharma Mukesh Valecha girish bada math kamal FULARA Ravi S. Ravi Kumar Pathak Faiza Manzoor Sudarshan Bhardwaj Shraddha Murshilli Saurabh Upadhyay Kripal Choudhary Abhishek Kaul Aashish Rathee Manan Choudhary DEBASIS BARMAN Ganesh M. … more",
