      "text": "𝐀𝐮𝐭𝐮𝐦𝐧 𝐢𝐬 𝐡𝐞𝐫𝐞, 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐬𝐨 𝐢𝐬 𝐭𝐡𝐞 𝐬𝐞𝐚𝐬𝐨𝐧 𝐨𝐟 𝐜𝐨𝐳𝐲 𝐰𝐨𝐫𝐤-𝐟𝐫𝐨𝐦-𝐡𝐨𝐦𝐞 𝐝𝐚𝐲𝐬!🍂 As temperatures drop and rainy mornings become more frequent, there’s something especially nice about working from the comfort of home. One of the things I really appreciate about working at Infineon Technologies is the flexibility to work from home 3 𝐝𝐚𝐲𝐬 𝐚 𝐰𝐞𝐞𝐤. And on those colder days, having that flexibility makes all the difference! But there’s one question we need to settle… 𝘈𝘳𝘦 𝘺𝘰𝘶 𝘛𝘦𝘢𝘮 𝘊𝘰𝘶𝘤𝘩 𝘰𝘳 𝘛𝘦𝘢𝘮 𝘋𝘦𝘴𝘬? I'm definitely Team Desk but with blanket and socks😁 #InfineonTechnologies #WeAreIn #HybridWork … more",
