      "id": "LI00728",
      "sourceId": "LI00728",
      "url": null,
      "text": "For some managers, remote work creates a terrible problem: There's nobody nearby to supervise. 😱 For many employees, remote work creates something even worse: Focus, energy, better sleep, and actual productivity. ❤️ Then comes the classic solution: \"Let's bring everyone back to the office — results will improve!\" 🚀 And suddenly: 😴 Less sleep 🚗 More commuting 🔊 More noise 💬 More interruptions 🧠 Less concentration 📉 Lower productivity 😤 Lower morale And eventually... lower results. Funny how that works. 😂 Sometimes productivity doesn't drop because people work from home. It drops because management confuses visibility with effectiveness. And when that happens, the best employees usually don't fight for the office. They update their CV. 😉 #RemoteWork #WorkFromHome #ReturnToOffice #Leadership #Management #Productivity #FutureOfWork #CorporateHumor … more",
