      "text": "We're Hiring: Technical Recruiters (Onsite-Lahore) | Join Our Growing Talent Acquisition Team 🚀 Our recruitment function is scaling, and we're adding two Technical Recruiters to the team. If you thrive in a fast-paced hiring environment and want to own end-to-end recruitment cycles, this could be your next move. Open Roles: 1️⃣ Mid-Level Technical Recruiter Salary Range: PKR 80,000 to PKR 100,000 per month You'll manage full-cycle recruitment, partner with hiring managers on role scoping, and drive offer negotiations with minimal hand-holding. 2️⃣ Entry-Level Technical Recruiter Salary Range: PKR 50,000 per month A great launchpad for someone eager to break into tech recruitment. You'll support sourcing, screening, and candidate engagement while learning the ropes from a seasoned team. What we're looking for: ✅ Plug-and-play recruiters who can hit the ground running ✅ Exposure to international recruitment is a strong plus ✅ Solid understanding of technical hiring and market mapping ✅ Strong stakeholder management and candidate experience skills This is an onsite role, so we need team players who value in-person collaboration also who can join on immediate basis. If you're ready to build high-performing teams and grow with us, drop a comment, send me a DM, or tag someone who'd be a great fit. #Hiring #TechnicalRecruiter #TalentAcquisition #Recruitment #WeAreHiring #TechHiring #HRJobs #RecruitingJobs #CareerOpportunity #TalentAcquisitionJobs #HiringAlert #JobsInPakistan … more",
