      "sourceId": "LI00811",
      "url": null,
      "text": "🔍 𝐖𝐇𝐀𝐓 𝐑𝐄𝐂𝐑𝐔𝐈𝐓𝐄𝐑𝐒 𝐀𝐂𝐓𝐔𝐀𝐋𝐋𝐘 𝐌𝐄𝐀𝐍 𝐖𝐇𝐄𝐍 𝐓𝐇𝐄𝐘 𝐒𝐀𝐘... \"𝐂𝐨𝐦𝐩𝐞𝐭𝐢𝐭𝐢𝐯𝐞 𝐬𝐚𝐥𝐚𝐫𝐲.\" Two little words that appear in plenty of job advertisements. But competitive with what, exactly? What's competitive for one person might be very different for another, depending on their experience, expectations and circumstances. And without a salary range, candidates are left guessing. 💼 For employers: Where possible, including a realistic salary range helps candidates understand whether an opportunity aligns with their expectations. It can also make those early recruitment conversations more straightforward. 👀 For candidates: Don't be afraid to ask about salary early in the process. It's a perfectly reasonable part of deciding whether a role is right for you. Salary transparency isn't about making money the only thing that matters. It's about helping both sides make informed decisions. And that's a pretty good starting point for any recruitment conversation. 😊 #TeamAbrivia #WhatRecruitersActuallyMean #SalaryTransparency #HiringInsights #Recruitment … more",
