      "text": "📢 I said what I said Attention Talent Acquisition Leadership and Decision Makers: As we move through the end of 2026 and the start of 2027, salary transparency is no longer optional, \"it is essential\" If publishing your salary ranges leads to fewer applicants, view it as a win for efficiency. It allows candidates to self select based on their needs, saving time for both the recruiter and the applicant. If you find the resulting candidate pool doesn't align with your requirements, it is a clear signal to: \"Either adjust the compensation or recalibrate the role's expectations\" 📢 And, by the way, no salary posted at all ? Expect job seekers to ignore the job posts🤦🏻‍♀️ #salarytransparency #fairwages #livablewages #honestjobdescriptions #transparentposts … more",
