      "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7522923235680636929/",
      "text": "𝗔𝘀𝗸 𝘁𝗵𝗶𝘀 𝗯𝗲𝗳𝗼𝗿𝗲 𝘆𝗼𝘂 𝗮𝗰𝗰𝗲𝗽𝘁 𝗮𝗻𝘆 𝗼𝗳𝗳𝗲𝗿 Pay transparency rules came into force in Malta in June 2026. Employers must now disclose a salary range before or at the start of the hiring process. You are entitled to ask. Most candidates still don't. Here is the exact sentence: \"Before we go further, could you share the budgeted salary range for this role?\" Twelve words. Professional. Completely reasonable. Legally backed. If a hiring manager pushes back or goes vague, that tells you something worth knowing before you sit through three rounds of interviews. Your time has a value. Ask the question. Part of The Remarkable Collective [link hidden] #Malta #TheRemarkableCollective … more",
