      "id": "LI00838",
      "sourceId": "LI00838",
      "url": null,
      "text": "Set your salary rules If salary matters to you, you can include a minimum in your job search routine. For example, you might look for a role paying more than 80K a year. When a company doesn't list pay, you can ask Claude to search using an assumed range, such as 70K to 90K a year. Save this for your next job search. #JobSearch #Salary #ClaudeAI … more",
