      "id": "LI00841",
      "sourceId": "LI00841",
      "url": null,
      "text": "Compensation continues to be one of the biggest factors in attracting and retaining good talent, and knowing where the market is headed can make all the difference. Our 2027 Salary Survey is officially out, covering projected salary ranges for more than 200 positions across Accounting, Finance, HR, Operations, and Technology. Whether you're planning your 2027 hiring strategy, budgeting for a new position, or simply curious where your compensation stacks up, this is a great resource. Take a look! 👇 [link hidden] #SalarySurvey #Hiring #Compensation #StaffingMadePersonal … more",
