      "text": "We’re hiring! Are you a public health data expert who loves transforming complex population health data into clear, actionable dashboards? BME Strategies is seeking an Advisor, Public Health Data Analytics & Visualization to help lead the Metrik initiative—a statewide effort modernizing and standardizing local public health data infrastructure across Massachusetts. Why you'll love working with us: 100% Remote-First: Work from home anywhere in the U.S. Flexible Time Off: Enjoy 4 weeks of PTO + 11 paid floating holidays per year High-Impact Work: Build Tableau, PowerBI, or QuickSight dashboards that directly support local health departments and state partners Collaborative Culture: Join an agile, equity-focused team where your expertise is valued at every level Key Qualifications: Master’s degree in Public Health, Epidemiology, Biostatistics, Data Analytics, or related quantitative field 6+ years of experience (including 2+ years in consulting & SQL proficiency) Expertise in BI visualization tools (Tableau, PowerBI, QuickSight) and public health datasets Location: Remote (U.S.) Salary Range: $87,360 – $120,640 / year Ready to make a statewide impact? Read the full job description and apply today! ⬇️ [link hidden] … more",
