      "text": "Budget season, hiring plans, and retention strategies all start with reliable market data. Our 2027 Tech Salary Guide is launching soon, featuring comprehensive salary data across 100+ tech roles and analysis of the latest hiring trends. As hiring expectations evolve, having access to current market insights can help you attract, hire, and retain the talent your organization needs. Join the waitlist now for early access and start 2027 with the insights you need to make informed hiring decisions: [link hidden] #WorkforceStrategy #HiringStrategy #ITStaffing #TechCareers #SalaryBenchmarking … more",
