      "text": "🦅🇺🇸 Somewhere in America, a bald eagle sheds a single tear every time an employer posts a job with \"Competitive Salary\" instead of an actual pay range. 🥲 Seriously, a little salary transparency goes a long way. It saves job seekers time, helps employers attract the right candidates, and makes everyone's job a little easier. 💰 Let's normalize sharing pay ranges in 2026. Do it for the eagle, do it for America. 🇺🇸🦅😂 #SalaryTransparency #Hiring #JobSeekers #Recruitment #VeteranEmployment #WorkforceDevelopment … more",
