      "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7523700363930193920/",
      "text": "STOP WAITING FOR YOUR BOSS TO NOTICE YOUR WORK! IT IS COSTING YOU PROMOTIONS AND PAY RAISES....! Here's how to turn ChatGPT into your personal career negotiator. No awkward guessing. No expensive coach. No walking into the conversation unprepared. Just 7 prompts to make your case clearly. TRACK YOUR WINS \"Help me build a log of my achievements this year. Ask me questions about projects, results, feedback, and problems I solved. Organize them by impact.\" TURN WINS INTO EVIDENCE \"Rewrite these accomplishments [paste] as short business-impact statements. Use numbers only where I provide them. Ask for missing data.\" RESEARCH YOUR VALUE \"Suggest how I can research a fair salary range for [role] in [location]. List the sources to check and the factors that affect pay.\" BUILD YOUR CASE \"Create a one-page talking-points outline for a promotion conversation. Include my results, my expanded responsibilities, and what I want.\" PRACTICE THE CONVERSATION \"Act as my manager. Push back with 5 common objections to my raise request. Help me respond calmly and professionally.\" PLAN FOR 'NO' \"If the answer is no, give me 5 follow-up questions and alternatives to ask for, like title, development budget, flexibility, or a review date.\" FOLLOW UP IN WRITING \"Write a short email summarizing what we discussed and agreed on, and the next step with a clear date.\" Here's what most professionals get wrong: They talk about what they NEED. But the strongest case is built on VALUE delivered. SHOW the results, the growth. AI can't guarantee a raise. But it can help you ask with confidence and evidence. Save this post before your next review. ♻️ Repost it for someone who deserves more. Follow me for practical AI prompts and career strategies. … more",
