      "url": null,
      "text": "Are your salary expectations keeping pace with the tech market? The technology hiring market has changed, but have your salary benchmarks changed with it? As businesses compete for specialist skills across Product, Design, Software Engineering and Data & AI, knowing what talent actually costs is essential. And it's not just permanent salaries. Contract day rates, specialist skill premiums and candidate expectations all play a part in building a realistic hiring budget. Get your figures wrong and you risk losing good candidates, delaying projects or spending more than you need to. Our 2026 Flexible Talent & Salary Insight Guide brings together current salary and contract day-rate benchmarks alongside insights into the changing technology recruitment market. Planning your next hire? Make sure you're working with the right information. 📥 Register to download your free copy: [link hidden] #SalaryGuide #TechHiring #SalaryBenchmarking #TalentStrategy #RMGDigital … more",
