      "text": "📊 Supply chain professionals: If you enjoy turning data into action, this opportunity may be worth a look. I’m recruiting for a Supply Chain Analyst to join our team in Aurora, Colorado. This isn’t a role where you’ll simply build reports and send them out. You’ll work closely with operations to connect supply planning, inventory, incoming materials, and production needs and use data to identify where we can improve. We’re especially interested in experience with: 🔹 Supply chain, inventory, or materials planning 🔹 Inventory analysis and root-cause problem solving 🔹 Advanced Excel 🔹 SAP or comparable ERP experience 🔹 KPI reporting and dashboards 🔹 Power BI experience is a plus 🔹 Strong supplier and stakeholder communication 📍 Aurora, CO | 100% onsite Salary range : $92,880 - $123,830 + Based on skill and experience 🚫 Relocation and sponsorship are not available If you enjoy digging into the numbers, understanding the “why” behind them, and helping operations make better decisions, I’d love to hear from you. 👉 Apply today or share this post with someone who should be on my radar. [link hidden] #SupplyChain #SupplyChainJobs #SupplyChainAnalytics #InventoryManagement #SAP #PowerBI #ColoradoJobs #Hiring … more",
