      "text": "JOB OPPORTUNITY: Chief Operating Officer (COO) Industry: Fashion Retail Salary Range: PKR 800,000 – 1,300,000 per month We are hiring on behalf of our client, a highly experienced and strategic Chief Operating Officer (COO) on behalf of our client, one of the leading Fashion Retail Brands. The ideal candidate with a strong leadership background in fashion retail, multi-store operations, business expansion, and operational excellence. The role requires a results driven leader capable of driving business growth, maximizing profitability, and strengthening overall operational performance. Key Performance Indicators (KPIs): Sales Performance: Achievement of monthly, quarterly, and annual sales targets. Like-for-Like (LFL) Growth: Improvement in comparable store sales. Store Profitability: Achievement of store-level gross margin and EBITDA targets. Sales Conversion Rate: Improvement in visitor-to-customer conversion. Average Transaction Value (ATV): Growth in average customer spending per transaction. Units Per Transaction (UPT): Improvement in the number of items sold per transaction. Inventory Turnover: Effective stock movement and inventory productivity. Stock Availability: Reduction in stock-outs and improvement in size-wise availability. Markdown Management: Control of discounts, clearance sales, and margin erosion. Shrinkage Control: Reduction in inventory losses, pilferage, and stock discrepancies. Store Operating Cost: Optimization of rent, utilities, manpower, and other operating expenses. Customer Experience: Improvement in customer satisfaction and service standards. New Store Performance: Timely store openings and achievement of business targets. People Productivity: Improvement in sales per employee and workforce efficiency. Required Qualifications & Experience: Bachelor's or Master's degree in Business Administration, Management, Retail Management, or a relevant discipline. 15+ years of professional experience in Fashion Retail. Strong experience in managing multi-location retail operations and large teams. Strong understanding of retail merchandising, inventory management, supply chain, and store economics. Experience in developing SOPs, KPIs, dashboards, and performance management systems. Top Leadership & Functional Skills: - P&L Ownership & Financial Acumen - Retail Sales Growth & Profitability - Inventory & Merchandise Management - Supply Chain & Distribution Management - Business Expansion & New Store Development How to Apply: Interested and qualified candidates are invited to share their updated CV at: Email: [email hidden] Subject Line: Application – Chief Operating Officer (COO – Fashion Retail) Only candidates with relevant senior-level Fashion Retail leadership experience will be considered. 🚀 Daily Jobs | ATS Resume Tips | Interview Guidance 🔹 LinkedIn: [link hidden] 🔹 Facebook: [link hidden] … more",
