      "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7523035033088196608/",
      "text": "As we approach the end of the year, Samari Consulting is making its latest Salary Benchmark Tunisia available free of charge to help both companies and candidates position themselves as effectively as possible for 2027. The full report provides insights into both current salary ranges and expected salary ranges across key functions and seniority levels, as well as bonus and employee benefit practices in Tunisia. Interested in receiving a free copy? Drop us a line at [email hidden] and we’ll be happy to share the full report with you. … more",
