      "url": null,
      "text": "In the Ibec Talent Trends and Pay Survey, 43% of respondents highlighted the EU Pay Transparency Directive as having the single greatest impact upon their organisations. In this article, Aoife McFadden, Senior Knowledge Centre Team Manager at Ibec, examines the Pay Transparency Directive in full, taking into consideration the organisational impacts that HR leaders are facing, and the legislative issues shaping the development of the Directive. Access the Ibec Talent, Trends and Pay Survey in full here: [link hidden] … more",
