      "sourceId": "LI00935",
      "url": null,
      "text": "Since the NCCIA's recent action against illegal call centers in Lahore, I've noticed a sharp rise in \"International Sales Executive\" ads on social media, often highlighting night shifts, \"competitive salaries,\" and little else. To be clear, many of these may be legitimate employers. But vague ads leave room for doubt, and in the current climate, transparency matters more than ever. Here's what Candidates should closely verify; -Verify the company's registration (e.g., with PSEB) -Look for a verifiable office address and a real web presence -Ask clearly about salary, role, and working conditions before the interview -Be cautious of any employer unwilling to answer these questions #JobSeekers #CareerAwareness #Pakistan #SalesJobs #Transparency #FreshGraduates … more",
