      "text": "It was fun chatting to Nick Ferrari on LBC last week about salary transparency (no, honestly, it was more fun than it sounds!). We were in violent agreement about how utterly pointless it is to advertise jobs without a salary range, even if we didn’t see eye to eye on everything else. And did I manage to steer the conversation towards early-career jobs and why I wrote Start Now? You better believe I did! If you can bear the sound of my voice (I am not a fan...) you can listen here 👇 [link hidden] Huge thanks to Rebecca Morrison for the opportunity. … more",
