      "id": "LI00957",
      "sourceId": "LI00957",
      "url": null,
      "text": "A Serious Concern Regarding Employee Rights and Pending Salary at Digitide I have been facing a very disappointing situation with Digitide. My salary has been pending for the last two months, and despite repeated attempts to seek clarification, I have received no proper response from the management. Furthermore, my registration is still not being approved, and I have been verbally informed that my employment has been terminated. However, no official written communication or clarification has been provided. I would like to ask the management: Is this how an organization should treat its employees? I have sincerely contributed my time and efforts to the organization, and I believe every employee deserves timely salary payments, transparent communication, and professional treatment. I expect Digitide to clear my pending salary and provide all applicable employment-related documents, including my experience letter and relieving letter, as per company policy and applicable law. If this matter remains unresolved, I will be compelled to escalate it to the Labour Department and pursue the appropriate legal remedies. I hope the concerned management takes this matter seriously and provides a fair and timely resolution. Employees deserve respect, transparency, and the salary they have rightfully earned Digitide #Digitide #EmployeeRights #PendingSalary #WorkplaceTransparency #EmployeeWelfare Ministry of Labour & Employment, Governme … more",
