      "text": "📢 New article: Pay Transparency across Europe: what comes next? My colleagues Carolien Van Echelpoel, Freya Potoms & Henri Kemseke have put together a great overview of where Europe stands following the transposition deadline of the EU Pay Transparency Directive, and more importantly, what employers should be preparing for now. The key message? Pay transparency goes far beyond gender pay gap reporting. It impacts recruitment, job architecture, pay structures, employee information rights, data, governance and communication. And while the Directive creates a common European framework, national approaches are already starting to differ. #PayTransparency #KPMGreward [link hidden] … more",
