      "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7523003159976497152/",
      "text": "𝐂𝐚𝐧 𝐞𝐦𝐩𝐥𝐨𝐲𝐞𝐫𝐬 𝐚𝐬𝐤 𝐜𝐚𝐧𝐝𝐢𝐝𝐚𝐭𝐞𝐬 𝐚𝐛𝐨𝐮𝐭 𝐭𝐡𝐞𝐢𝐫 𝐬𝐚𝐥𝐚𝐫𝐲 𝐞𝐱𝐩𝐞𝐜𝐭𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧𝐬 𝐝𝐮𝐫𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐫𝐞𝐜𝐫𝐮𝐢𝐭𝐦𝐞𝐧𝐭? The 𝐄𝐔 𝐏𝐚𝐲 𝐓𝐫𝐚𝐧𝐬𝐩𝐚𝐫𝐞𝐧𝐜𝐲 𝐃𝐢𝐫𝐞𝐜𝐭𝐢𝐯𝐞 𝐢𝐧𝐭𝐫𝐨𝐝𝐮𝐜𝐞𝐬 𝐧𝐞𝐰 𝐫𝐮𝐥𝐞𝐬 𝐨𝐧 𝐬𝐚𝐥𝐚𝐫𝐲 𝐢𝐧𝐟𝐨𝐫𝐦𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐢𝐧 𝐫𝐞𝐜𝐫𝐮𝐢𝐭𝐦𝐞𝐧𝐭, including restrictions on asking candidates about their current or previous salary. In this LVP Brief, Madalena Mourão explains what employers may ask candidates and what information they must provide about the salary or salary range for a position. 📖 Read the full LVP Brief to understand the implications for employers and candidates: [link hidden] #EmploymentLaw #PayTransparency #PortugueseLaw #LVPBrief … more",
