      "text": "Open and Transparent Discussion with Job Applicants About Salary and Benefits: The company should have a direct and transparent discussion with job applicants regarding salary, benefits, and employment conditions before recruitment. * Clearly explain the offered salary. * Discuss accommodation and transportation facilities. * Clarify food allowances and other benefits. * Explain duty hours, overtime, and weekly holidays. * Discuss annual leave and medical benefits. * Clarify contract terms and salary payment dates. * Avoid false promises or hidden conditions. * Ensure mutual understanding before finalizing employment. To maintain transparency, build trust, and prevent future misunderstandings or dissatisfaction. … more",
