      "text": "🇮🇳 India's New Labour Codes – A Step Towards Better Employee Rights! India's updated labour framework aims to bring greater transparency, better social security and stronger workplace protection. 🔹 Fair wage structure 🔹 Improved gratuity provisions 🔹 Timely salary payments 🔹 Overtime protection 🔹 Better employee benefits Remember: Knowing your rights is the first step towards protecting them. Let's build a fairer and more transparent workplace! 📚 Source: Ministry of Labour & Employment, Government of India. #LabourCodes #EmployeeRights #LabourLaw #HR #India #Wagesalary … more",
