      "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7523458931835342848/",
      "text": "Radical transparency in employee benefits starts with four questions: • What are we paying in premiums, fees, and commissions? • What do claims and utilization actually show? • Which service providers receive direct or indirect compensation? • How are the numbers checked? For an employer comparing fully insured, level funded, self funded, or ICHRA approaches, those answers belong beside employee experience and risk. ERISA plan fiduciaries also need a documented way to evaluate and monitor providers and fees. Soaring Benefits helps employers and brokers work through these questions. Which number is hardest to get from your current benefits reporting? … more",
