      "text": "We checked 39 academy trusts. Here is how many could show they pay above the national scale: 3. The Academy Trust Teacher Pay Transparency Index sorts trusts by what can actually be verified from pay policies, job adverts and reporting: National scale: 25 Live dispute: 6 Uncertain pay: 5 Above scale: 3 It is a map of the evidence, not a league table. Statuses can change, and we update them when they do. Working for a trust or thinking of joining one? Check it before you sign: [link hidden] Does your trust publish its pay policy somewhere you can actually find it? #AcademyTrusts #TeacherPay #Teachers #PayTransparency … more",
