      "text": "Pay transparency feels overwhelming when you picture doing it all at once. So don’t. Year 1️⃣ - Executives get aligned on your comp philosophy, approach and process. Year 2️⃣ - Directors and above get the same clarity (as above). Year 3️⃣ - Managers share pay decisions with each employee. Phased approach is the key. What phase is your company in right now? … more",
