      "text": "The Pay Transparency Directive reports on 2026 data. That's this year. Most firms will discover in 2027 that their payroll system only delivers aggregated figures - and that you can't calculate a median from an average. Those who get their data foundation right now will get a report. Everyone else gets a project. Have you tested whether your systems can actually deliver the numbers the directive requires? … more",
