      "url": null,
      "text": "newvisionsearchpartners Let me hold your hand and say... “Competitive” is not a number. Job seekers want to know what they are walking into. The role, the expectations, and YES, the paycheck. Not posting pay does not make a company look strategic. It makes them look out of touch. Transparency will not scare talent away.. I promise. It will only bring the right people closer. … more",
