      "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7524074818984431616/",
      "text": "Introducing Integrated HRMS & Payroll with EssentialSFA! Manage your Field Force, Employees, Attendance and Payroll – All on One Integrated Platform. *Say goodbye to disconnected systems and manual payroll calculations!* With EssentialSFA's Integrated HRMS & Payroll, streamline your complete employee management and salary processing workflow. ✨ Key Features: ✅ Employee & HR Management ✅ Attendance & Leave Integration with EssentialSFA ✅ AI Face Verification for Attendance ✅ Live Employee Location Tracking ✅ Geo-Fenced Attendance ✅ Custom Salary Heads & Structures ✅ Automated Salary Calculation & Generation – One Click for the Entire Organization ✅ PF, ESI, TDS & Other Deduction Management ✅ Detailed Payroll Reports & MIS ✅ Salary Slips Directly on Employees' Existing Mobile App 💡 One Smart Integration. Complete Employee Management. Simplified Payroll. Connect your field operations with HR and Payroll to improve productivity, transparency and operational efficiency. 📩 Looking for an Integrated HRMS & Payroll Solution? *Contact us for a FREE DEMO!* 🌐 [link hidden] 📞 [phone hidden] 📧 [email hidden] #EssentialSFA #HRMS #PayrollSoftware #HRManagement #PayrollAutomation … more",
