      "id": "LI01029",
      "sourceId": "LI01029",
      "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7523777931525902336/",
      "text": "Many employees are told that salary revisions are not possible due to budget constraints, business conditions, or client limitations. Yet, in Many organizations, promotions and increments for certain functions continue without interruption (HR & PO) This raises an important question: Are we truly recognizing and rewarding those who directly contribute to project delivery and business success? A motivated workforce is built on fairness, transparency, and equal recognition. Retaining experienced and hardworking employees should be as important as promoting leadership and support functions. Great organizations don't just reward positions—they reward performance, contribution, and commitment. #Leadership #EmployeeEngagement #SalaryReview #WorkplaceFairness #TalentRetention #HR #Management #CareerGrowth #LinkedInPost … more",
