      "text": "I'm looking for an innovative 'Head of Reward' to work in an interesting multi layered organisation (Group and diverse investment portfolio / subsidiary structure). You will be based in London (Hybrid) and lead a small team across a key region for the business. £165,000 + 25-30% Bonus + Benefits You will be experienced and interested in setting up a new Reward Philosophy for the UK and RoW, leading a small team and adapting 'home country' Reward Philosophy and ethos into a competitive, fit-for-purpose compensation, benefits and recognition frameworks across the UK and RoW. This shift will focus in part on adopting a 'Pay for Performance' culture and be embedded across Job-Architecture /G-G-Structure and maintained within annual salary and bonus review periods. You will ensure compliance with the EU Pay Transparency Directive, pay gap reporting and other regulatory requirements whilst advising senior leadership, subsidiary/portfolio boards and RemCo's on reward strategies. In line with the changing ethos / Reward Philosophy you will look to utilise and improve HR systems and analytics to track KPIs, inform decisions and report on reward programme effectiveness. [email hidden] … more",
