      "id": "LI01060",
      "sourceId": "LI01060",
      "url": null,
      "text": "⚠️It's done Bro. Cypherox Technologies Pvt Ltd. | Tulika Singh Sometimes, staying silent is no longer an option. I never thought I’d have to bring a professional issue onto a public platform. But after months of trying to resolve this internally with zero accountability, staying silent is no longer an option. When I decided to leave Cypherox Technologies, I expected a standard, professional exit. Instead: •21 days of my earned salary remain completely unpaid. • My access to attendance records and company systems was revoked on my very last day, locking me out of my own work history because they don't want to pay amount so. • Repeated follow-ups with HR and management were met with radio silence and restricted communication channels and they blocked me from everywhere including WhatsApp. I eventually decided to leave the organization because of several concerns: • Unhealthy work environment • Poor work-life balance • Office politics • Lack of management support • An overall workplace culture that made it difficult to continue working there The worst part? I am not the only one. Other former colleagues have faced the exact same treatment. and also i receive my security cheque after long time and many follow-ups. We aren't asking for favors or corporate goodwill. We are asking for the money we spent our time, energy, and effort earning. I have kept full documentation, screenshots, and communication records of everything. To the management at Cypherox - Take responsibility. I expect an immediate settlement of my 21 days’ pending pay and a clear, written response to close this matter. A company's real character shows in how it treats people when they walk out the door. We deserve transparency, respect, and to be paid for the work we do. #CypheroxTechnologies #EmployeeRights #UnpaidSalary #WorkplaceCulture … more",
