      "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7523777511508533249/",
      "text": "𝗔 𝘀𝗮𝗹𝗮𝗿𝘆 𝗶𝘀 𝗻𝗼𝘁 𝗮 𝗳𝗮𝘃𝗼𝘂𝗿. 𝗜𝘁'𝘀 𝗮𝗻 𝗲𝗺𝗽𝗹𝗼𝘆𝗲𝗲'𝘀 𝗿𝗶𝗴𝗵𝘁. Every employee works hard, puts in their time, meets deadlines, and fulfils responsibilities. But when salary gets delayed, it's not just a payment that's late. It's someone's rent, EMIs, family responsibilities, and monthly plans that get affected. Employees have commitments too. They deserve financial stability, respect, and transparency. A company expects professionalism from its employees. Employees deserve the same professionalism from their employers. Pay salaries on time. Respect people's hard work. #WorkplaceCulture #EmployeeRights #Professionalism #WorkEthics … more",
