      "text": "🔎 JD X-RAY #99: 🚨 PHONEPE IS HIRING A SENIOR PRODUCT MANAGER. I opened the JD. [[link hidden]] ✔️Found the roadmap. ✔️Found the metrics. ✔️Found the strategy. ✔️Found the cost and revenue accountability. But I have one tiny question… WHICH PRODUCT? 😂 The JD says: “Own a suite of products.” Candidate: “Lovely. Which suite?” Recruiter: “The product suite.” Candidate: “No, I meant… WHAT PRODUCT?” 🤣 Here's your 60-second PM exercise: Before applying, find these 4 things: 1. Named customer. 2. Actual product boundary. 3. Business problem. 4. Metric you will own. Because a roadmap without a clearly understood product is just a very expensive calendar. 😂 PMs, what's the most important thing you've had to ask a recruiter because the JD conveniently forgot to mention it? 👇 Let's hear the real stories. #ProductManagement #PhonePe #ProductJobs #ProductLeadership #CareerStrategy #HiringPanelLens",
