      "text": "The best consumer product is the one that makes customers come back without having to think twice. Fewer confusing journeys. Fewer unnecessary clicks. Fewer \"where do I find this?\" moments. At OZi, we're building commerce for moms and kids, making it easier for parents to discover and shop everything their little ones need. And great consumer experiences don't happen by accident. They come from understanding customer behaviour, identifying friction, and building products that make everyday shopping simpler. I'm hiring a Consumer Product Manager! Someone who is obsessed with customer experience, curious about consumer behaviour, and excited about solving real problems. Someone who can turn customer insights into product experiences, simplify complex journeys, improve conversions, and build features that customers genuinely love using. You'll work on problems across the entire consumer journey — from discovery and search to product listing, checkout, payments, and post-purchase experience. If you enjoy building consumer-facing products and have shipped experiences that people actually love, share your details here: [link hidden] Also, share something you've built and are proud of. Know someone who would be a great fit? Tag them below! #Hiring #ProductManager #ConsumerProduct #ConsumerTech #ProductManagement #ProductJobs #ProductHiring #Ecommerce #D2C #QuickCommerce #ProductInnovation #StartupJobs #BuildProducts Abhishek Goyal Kartik Joshi Charishma Motwani Shail Patel",
