      "id": "LI02022",
      "sourceId": "LI02022",
      "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:share:7528279419929600000/",
      "text": "🚀 WE'RE HIRING: PRODUCT MANAGER Think Big. Solve Problems. Build Products. Work Remotely. Got ideas? We want to hear them! We're looking for a curious and creative Product Manager who enjoys understanding user needs, breaking down problems, and turning ideas into meaningful products. Here's the exciting part: We don't limit talent by industry background or years of experience. Whether you're an experienced professional, an aspiring Product Manager, or someone looking to explore a new career path, we're interested in how you think, learn, and bring ideas to life. 🌍 Work Arrangement: Remote Work Opportunity 💡 WHAT YOU'LL DO * Product Research & Planning: Conduct market research and competitor analysis to identify opportunities and support product planning. * Requirement Analysis & Design: Work with business stakeholders to understand requirements, analyze user needs, prepare product documentation, and create product prototypes. * Product Development: Collaborate closely with engineering teams to turn product concepts and requirements into real solutions. * Product Optimization: Gather user insights, analyze industry trends, and drive continuous product improvements and iterations. * Cross-functional Collaboration: Coordinate with different teams, streamline workflows, and ensure smooth product execution. 🔍 WHAT WE'RE LOOKING FOR We value your mindset and potential more than just your resume. *No specific industry background, years of experience, or project experience required. *Strong user-oriented mindset with the ability to understand and identify user needs. *Structured thinking and problem-solving skills with the ability to break down complex business requirements. *Good communication skills and the ability to collaborate with different teams. *Curious about new products and technologies, with a willingness to learn and improve continuously. ⭐ NICE TO HAVE *Experience, internship, or personal project exposure in AI-related products. *Familiarity with AI tools and their applications in requirement analysis, product planning, or prototyping. *A genuine interest in emerging technologies and innovative product solutions. 🎁 WHY JOIN US? 1. 🌍 Remote Work Flexibility: Enjoy the opportunity to work remotely. 2. 💡 Room for Creativity: Share your ideas and contribute to real product development. 3. 🚀 Growth Opportunities: Explore different business scenarios, product strategies, and emerging technologies. 4. 🤝 Collaborative Environment: Work closely with business and engineering teams to bring ideas to life. 📩 READY TO BUILD SOMETHING MEANINGFUL? You don't need to know everything. You just need to be curious, think critically, and be ready to make things happen. Send us your resume and let's explore what we can build together! #Hiring #ProductManager #RemoteJobs #TechCareers #AIProduct #ProductDevelopment #NowHiring",
