      "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:share:7528338919659220992/",
      "text": "We are Hiring ! Product Manager - ALLEN Digital About ALLEN Digital After dominating the offline tutoring market for over three decades, ALLEN is now building the next frontier in education through ALLEN Digital.ALLEN Digital was created as a strategic partnership between ALLEN Careers Institute and Bodhi Tree Systems, with the goal of building a technology platform that transforms how students learn. Our ambition is simple but bold: build the most effective learning platform for students at scale. Traditional coaching institutes deliver outcomes but are constrained by geography and largely lack personalization and data-driven learning. Digital education platforms have improved access but have struggled to deliver deep engagement and consistent outcomes.At ALLEN Digital, we believe the future lies in combining the pedagogical strength of classroom learning with the power of technology.As we scale our digital business, we are building world-class product, design, and technology teams in Bangalore to: ● Build next-generation digital learning experiences ● Create personalized learning journeys for every student ● Deliver category-defining learning outcomes at scale Role: Product Manager As a Product Manager at ALLEN Digital, you will contribute to building a cutting-edge education platform that brings the best of offline learning to the digital world, with a focus on personalization, engagement, and scalable learning outcomes. You will work at the intersection of learning science, technology, and data, translating student needs and business objectives into impactful product experiences that improve the student learning journey. This role requires strong product thinking, analytical rigor, customer empathy, and execution excellence. Background & Experience ● 2–4 years of product management experience ● Experience building consumer-facing digital products, preferably at scale ● Experience owning product features or workstreams from problem discovery to launch ● Strong motivation to solve meaningful problems in education for students, teachers, and parents. ● Bachelor's degree, preferably from a strong engineering institution. ● MBA from Tier 1 business schools (IIMs, ISB) preferred, but not mandatory Please share your resume to [email hidden] along with Your current CTC,Notice period and ECTC. Preetha G Saket Kumar Dwivedy Karan Sehgal",
