      "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:share:7528070531833708544/",
      "text": "We’re hiring Product Manager at Spinny 🚗 | Gurugram At Spinny, we’re changing how India buys and sells cars, with trust, transparency and a smooth experience from search to doorstep delivery. To build what comes next, we’re looking for a Product Manager to join our Product team. What you’ll do: - Own products end to end, from finding the problem through discovery, launch and iteration - Work closely with Engineering, Design, Data, Business and Operations to ship what matters - Turn customer insights and data into a clear roadmap and well-reasoned priorities - Define success metrics, run experiments and keep raising the bar on outcomes - Build for both consumer-facing experiences and the internal platforms behind a complex, high-scale business What we’re looking for: - 3+ years of product management experience - A strong analytical mindset that’s comfortable with data, SQL or analytics tools - A track record of shipping products that moved real business or user metrics - Clear communication and the ability to align many stakeholders - An ownership mindset and a bias for action in a fast-moving environment Bonus: experience in consumer internet, marketplaces, e-commerce or ops-heavy businesses Why Spinny: - Solve real, messy problems at scale in a category that’s being redefined - High ownership and direct impact on business outcomes - A collaborative, fast-paced team that values first-principles thinking 📍 Location: Gurugram (Work from Office) 💼 Experience: 3+ years 👉 Apply here: [link hidden] Know someone who’d be a great fit? Tag them or share this post! 🙌 #Hiring #ProductManagement #ProductManager #Spinny #ProductJobs #NowHiring Arushi Arora Akash Shukla Ramanshu Mahaur Shweta Singh Amit Shekhar Karan Kumar Shivam Mittal Shobhit Jain Abhishek Shome Cheshtha Sharma Susmita Shaw [name hidden] [name hidden]",
