      "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:ugcPost:7526913412921057280/",
      "text": "If you're a Nigerian Product Manager looking for a remote role, don't scroll past this one! I found 6 companies hiring Product Managers remotely, and I thought it was worth putting them all in one place. You don't have to relocate before you can work with an international team. Sometimes, you just need to know where the opportunities are and be intentional about applying. A few tips before you start applying: ~You can search for the roles directly here on LinkedIn or go straight to each company's careers page. ~Set up accounts on BambooHR and Blupe to discover more job opportunities. ~Whenever you come across PM job openings on X or LinkedIn, engage with the posts. Like, comment, repost or save them. The more you interact with this kind of content, the more likely the algorithm is to show you similar opportunities on your feed. And when you apply, do it with a good heart. Don't count yourself out before the hiring team has had a chance to consider you. You never know which application could open a new door. I'm also thinking of making this a weekly thing, sharing remote PM opportunities worth checking out. Would that be helpful? Have a great Friday, and an even better weekend. ❤️ P.S. Tag a Product Manager who needs to see this. Don't keep all the opportunities to yourself!",
