      "text": "🚀 WE ARE HIRING | Product Manager – KYC / Customer Onboarding We are looking for an experienced and passionate Product Manager to drive the vision, strategy, roadmap, and execution of our KYC and Customer Onboarding platform. The ideal candidate will have strong experience in enterprise product management, preferably within Banking, NBFCs, Mutual Funds, Financial Services, or RegTech domains. 🎯 Role & Responsibilities: 🔹 Product Strategy & Roadmap: Define product vision, strategy, and roadmap aligned with business goals, customer expectations, and regulatory requirements. 🔹 Requirement Analysis: Engage with business stakeholders and customers to gather requirements and translate them into BRDs, FRDs, functional specifications, user stories, and acceptance criteria. 🔹 KYC & Onboarding Workflows: Drive customer onboarding processes covering PAN, Aadhaar, OVD validation, CKYC, KRA, document verification, exception handling, and approval workflows. 🔹 Stakeholder Management: Collaborate with Engineering, UI/UX, QA, DevOps, Compliance, and Business teams to ensure successful product development and delivery. 🔹 Agile Product Delivery: Manage product backlogs, prioritize features, participate in sprint planning, backlog refinement, sprint reviews, and coordinate timely releases. 🔹 Technical Integrations: Work with technical architects and development teams on REST APIs, JSON/XML data exchange, XSD, SFTP integrations, data validation, security, and audit requirements. 🔹 Product Quality & UAT: Define acceptance criteria, validate delivered features, coordinate UAT, and ensure product quality before production releases. 🔹 Innovation & Optimization: Identify opportunities to leverage AI, OCR, automation, and intelligent document processing to improve KYC verification and onboarding efficiency. 🎓 Required Skills & Experience: ✅ 5–8 years of experience in Product Management, Product Ownership, or Business Analysis. ✅ Strong experience in enterprise application development and product lifecycle management. ✅ Prior experience in Banking, NBFCs, Mutual Funds, Financial Services, KYC, or Customer Onboarding platforms. ✅ Good understanding of CKYC, KRA, PAN, Aadhaar, OVD, and customer identity verification processes. ✅ Hands-on experience with Agile methodologies, Jira, Confluence, BRDs, FRDs, and product backlog management. ✅ Knowledge of REST APIs, JSON, XML, XSD, SFTP, databases, application architecture, security, encryption, and audit trails. ✅ Excellent analytical, problem-solving, communication, and stakeholder management skills. 📩 Interested candidates: Share your updated resume to [email hidden] or WhatsApp: [phone hidden] #Hiring #ProductManager #KYC #CustomerOnboarding #ProductManagement #Banking #FinTech #NBFC #MutualFunds #RegTech #Agile #Jira #CareerOpportunity",
