      "postId": "LI00005",
      "text": "The statistic that around one in eight young people are not in education, employment, or training is staggering. I am really curious to hear more about how the NEON network actually connects employers with local organizations to provide that ongoing support. It sounds like a practical and effective way to create sustainable work opportunities. [name hidden] … more",
