      "text": "This is the kind of design problem I love: changing behaviour, not just screens. I've been working on something close with AlvoTriX, a wearable safety product where the hard part was never the UI, but getting people to act on what the data told them. Telematics rewards have the same challenge: making \"driving well\" feel like a win, not surveillance. Applying now. 🙂 … more",
