      "id": "CM0041",
      "sourceId": "CM0041",
      "postId": null,
      "text": "Those that use Recruiter will still use Indeed is spot on Tom. Nobody sources from a single channel anymore. The catch is that every extra channel adds admin. From talking to solo and boutique recruiters, the time sink isn't finding candidates, it's copying profiles into the CRM and chasing replies across different tools. For the 78% who voted yes, are you after better reach, or less admin once you've found someone? … more",
