      "postId": null,
      "text": "Tom Wood Recruiter and Indeed cover the big pools, but the best candidates often sit outside both. Jump Recruiter is a strong complement: it helps you reach active job seekers faster and cut sourcing time. Worth adding to the stack: [link hidden] AI Job Search Engine & Free Job Finder | Jump Recruiter [link hidden]",
