      "postId": null,
      "text": "As an owl, we prefer \"more ways to catch a mouse.\" 🦉🐭 But yes, raising a wing here! [name hidden] works alongside the tools you already have. Our AI agent searches every publicly available profile on the internet (not just one network), ranks the right candidates, and handles outreach. Great for finding the people who aren't active on the usual platforms. 30 day free trial starts automatically if anyone wants to add another string to the bow. 🏹 … more",
