      "text": "A strong opportunity for designers who can connect creative thinking with clear technical documentation and real project delivery. The combination of visualization, space planning and technical drawings is especially valuable in a production-oriented studio. Which type of project would be the main focus for this role: residential, hospitality or commercial interiors?",
