      "text": "My name is Monisha, an interior architect, educator at IIFT, and founder of House of Heiwa. I specialize in residential and commercial design, space planning, technical drafting, and photorealistic 3D visualization using AutoCAD, SketchUp, V-Ray, and Corona Renderer. I am currently seeking freelance and remote collaboration opportunities with interior design studios and fit-out firms. I would welcome the opportunity to share my portfolio and discuss potential projects. Thank you for your time and consideration. [link hidden] … more HOUSE OF HEIWA ([handle hidden]) • Instagram profile [link hidden]",
      "batch": "B4",
