      "sourceId": "CM0425",
      "postId": "LI01091",
      "text": "Hi Kolda Tech team! I'm genuinely interested in applying for this Motion Designer opportunity and would love to be considered for the role. However, I'm currently facing a technical issue with your application form. Whenever I click the \"Submit Application\" button, an error appears, preventing me from completing my application. I'd appreciate it if you could look into this issue or suggest an alternative way to apply. I'm also interested in a remote working arrangement. Portfolio: [link hidden] Thank you!",
