      "sourceId": "CM0699",
      "postId": "LI01145",
      "text": "Hi, I’m currently a Graphic Designer at a performance marketing agency, where I’ve worked on landing pages and digital campaigns for brands like DTDC and telecrm. I’m transitioning further into UI/UX and have been building my portfolio around real-world web experiences and product design. I believe my visual design background and understanding of conversion-focused design could bring value to your team. Here’s a selection of my work: [link hidden] Would love to know your thoughts and be considered for the opportunity! [email hidden] [phone hidden] … more [name hidden] - Graphic Designer in Bhopal, India [link hidden]",
