      "sourceId": "CM0702",
      "postId": "LI01148",
      "text": "A record-breaking edition is also a good stress test: four days of four halls means the stands that survive are the ones where the light was specified with headroom, the demo had spares, and somebody could reach the drivers without dismantling a wall. The interesting question for next year is not the size, it is how many exhibitors ask for service access in the brief. Did that number go up?",
