      "id": "CM01000",
      "sourceId": "CM01000",
      "postId": "LI02000",
      "text": "Interested! Lending products are won at the funnel: where an applicant drops between eligibility and disbursal, and how fast a partner can fix it. I built products inside bank lending journeys, including an RBL gold loan product that issued 100 policies in its first five days, and traced one product’s drop-off through dashboards for a 20% penetration and 10% ticket-size lift. I have emailed my CV and would welcome the opportunity to be considered.",
