      "id": "CM01015",
      "sourceId": "CM01015",
      "postId": "LI02005",
      "text": "Strong initiative. With a communication agent, the hard part is knowing when to hand off to a person. I've built agents with approval gates and eval suites, and I'm applying. Would love to connect.",
