      "sourceId": "CM01074",
      "postId": "LI02034",
      "text": "[name hidden] this job needs someone with good problem solving skills and a strategic mindset thinking. I bring years of experience to the table, I am excited to find out more about this role, currently based in the UK , I am looking for remote opportunities. Can we discuss further please ?",
