      "sourceId": "CM01181",
      "postId": "LI02083",
      "text": "Hi Yendri, thank you for sharing the Fuze Health Product Manager role. I was drawn to the focus on deciding which user problem to solve first, and to the personalized, data-driven work in health tech. I have 3+ years of product experience, and at Marketeq Digital, where I have worked since May 2026, I lead payments and earnings features, including payout settlement across 6 methods with fraud controls. I have also built AI product prototypes with OpenAI and Anthropic APIs, which fits the AI-enabled side of this role. I would love to be considered, and I am happy to share my resume.",
